        <level2>
          <h2>2.3 Sidebar Callout Card (BANA §12 Boxlines)</h2>
          <sidebar id="sidebar-1" render="required">
            <hd>Discovery Spotlight: Deep Sea Hydrothermal Vents</hd>
            <p>
              Hydrothermal vents host unique ecosystems powered by <em>chemosynthesis</em> rather than solar photosynthesis.
            </p>
            <list type="ul">
              <li><strong>Organisms:</strong> Giant tube worms, vent crabs, and thermophilic archaebacteria.</li>
              <li><strong>Energy Source:</strong> Hydrogen sulfide oxidation from geothermal subterranean fissures.</li>
            </list>
          </sidebar>
        </level2>
      </level1>

